+namespace sm20 {
+// Fix25 (God of War log 53: nvOFExecute held the game's Present thread for
+// 8.2 ms per pair while the flow itself took 1.4 ms of GPU time): the D3D11
+// NVOF call waits on the CPU for the GPU to finish the frame it reads. That
+// wait now happens on a worker thread with its own D3D11 device on the same
+// adapter. The frames and flow textures are shared with it; two shared
+// fences order the work on the GPU (game capture -> flow -> synthesis), so
+// the game thread only queues the work and returns.
+class AsyncFlow {
